# Authored content is never reformatted.
#
# The pre-commit hook runs `prettier --write` over every *.md file. Prettier
# reflows markdown — list markers, emphasis characters, line wrapping, table
# padding — and src/content/ holds documents bylined by named staff plus
# summaries of other people's research. A formatter silently rewriting those
# is not acceptable, and frontmatter shape is already enforced by
# `npm run content:validate` against src/lib/schemas.ts.
#
# Documentation in docs/ and at the repo root IS formatted; only the OKF
# bundle is protected.
